  "notes": "Running header (company/store left, form name right) and footer \"Лист n из N\" are furniture on every page; page-number lines listed per page. The inventory table CONTINUES ACROSS PAGES 1 AND 2 with its header repeated by Chrome on page 2; it is ONE table with the header row once. It has a two-level header: \"№\", \"Наименование товара\", \"Артикул\", \"Ед. изм.\" and \"Цена, руб.\" span both header rows and repeat; \"Количество\" spans two columns (учётное, фактическое) and \"Расхождение\" spans two columns (кол-во, сумма, руб.), each repeated. Department rows span all columns; subtotal rows and the final total row are rows of the same table. Commission members are a CSS-drawn numbered list. Signature captions are body text. Russian uses ё as printed."
